  "difficulty": "medium",
  "summary": "武曲化权被解释为增强权柄、自信、企图心及求财积极性；作者称武曲与巨门化权还兼化禄的顺畅作用，但这不是说二星同时化禄。武曲坐命及大限逢之同论，前提须旺宫化权且有吉星；无吉多煞则可变成过度自信、刚愎自用，反显负面。",
  "summary_en": "The author says Wu Qu Hua Quan strengthens authority, confidence, ambition and active wealth seeking. Wu Qu and Ju Men Hua Quan are described as also having the smoothness associated with Hua Lu; this is an analogy of effects, not a claim that they also transform to Hua Lu. The Wu Qu interpretation applies in the Life Palace and grand cycles only with strong placement and auspicious support. Without such support and with many harmful stars, overconfidence and obstinacy may amplify negative traits.",
